{
  "slug": "adspirer-ads-agent",
  "name": "Adspirer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Cross-platform ad management for Google Ads, Meta Ads, TikTok Ads, and LinkedIn Ads. 91 tools for keyword research, campaign creation, performance analysis, and budget optimization.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **15 skills**, **1 agent**, **5 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (15): `adspirer-agent` (Paid-media advertising agent behavior for Adspirer — create, analyze, and optimize ad campaigns across Google Ads, Meta, TikTok,…), `adspirer-amazon-ads` (Create and manage Amazon Ads through Adspirer — Sponsored Products, Sponsored Brands, and Sponsored Display, with ASIN targeting,…), `adspirer-chatgpt-ads` (Create and manage ChatGPT Ads (OpenAI Ads) through Adspirer — ads that appear inside ChatGPT responses), `adspirer-creative` (Write and refresh ad creative with Adspirer — headlines, descriptions, primary text, and ad copy for Google, Meta,…), `adspirer-docs` (Answer questions about Adspirer itself — pricing, plans, quota and tool-call limits, what Adspirer can do, connecting an…), `adspirer-get-started` (Install and set up Adspirer — the AI advertising agent for Google Ads, Meta Ads (Facebook & Instagram),…), `adspirer-google-ads` (Create and manage Google Ads campaigns through Adspirer — Search, Performance Max, Demand Gen, YouTube, and Display), `adspirer-launch` (Plan and launch a new ad campaign with Adspirer — start, create, set up, or launch campaigns on…), and 7 more\n- **Agents** (1): `performance-marketing-agent` (Brand-specific performance marketing agent)\n- **Commands** (5): `performance-review` (Run a cross-platform performance review for this brand), `refresh-brand-context` (Re-scan brand docs and update CLAUDE.md with latest info), `setup` (Set up your brand workspace — connect to Adspirer and pull campaign data), `wasted-spend` (Find and fix wasted ad spend across all platforms), `write-ad-copy` (Write brand-voice-compliant ad copy for a specific platform)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `adspirer`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install adspirer-ads-agent@knowledge-work-plugins` from `amekala/adspirer-mcp-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
